# Always deploy to production

When the user asks for a change on this site, finish by putting it on production without waiting to be asked:

1. Commit the relevant files (concise message focused on why).
2. Push the current branch to `origin` (`git push -u origin HEAD`). Production is Vercel on `main`.
3. Return the production URL or confirm the push succeeded.

Do not ask first. Do not leave finished work only on the local machine.

Never force-push, skip hooks, amend a pushed commit, or update git config unless the user explicitly requests that.
